      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I learned a temporary workaround: You can set the Scroll Sensitivity property of the Scroll Rect component to 0 to fix this. It's not an ideal solution but it at least fixes most of the issue. You will still be able to scroll the Scroll View in-game by clicking and dragging even with the sensitivity set to 0.",
